scenario 2
tick_rate 25
# BUG-009: a walk with the left button held goes on after a cast with the
# right button; the cast does not end the held walk.
name bug-009-held-walk-after-cast
seed 1234
end 70
# A level 30 Sorceress with Fire Ball (skill 47) at 20, in the Blood Moor,
# with mana refilled every tick (god) so the cast always goes out.
char class 1
char level 30
char skill 47 20
char area 0 2
at 0 dev god on
# Hold the left button east of her: she walks there and keeps walking.
at 2 input down L 560 300
by 12 check player.mode == walk
# Cast Fire Ball with the right button while the left is still down.
at 14 input cast fireball at 560 260
at 15 input wait-until player.mode == cast max 15
# The cast ends and the held walk resumes.
at 16 input wait-until player.mode == walk max 25
at 17 input up L 560 300
